# The Myriad Pools: "Whenever you cast a permanent spell using mana produced by The Myriad Pools" (CR 601.2h, 106.3, 110.4a). On
# turn 5 its {U} and Mox Sapphire's {U} are both in the pool: Faerie Miscreant is paid with the Moxen's (`Spend: U`), so no mana the
# Pools produced was spent and nothing triggers; Unsummon is then paid with the Pools' {U} but is no permanent spell. On turn 7 a
# Vodalian Mage, paid {2}{U} with the Pools' {U} and Mox Jet's and Mox Ruby's mana together, is a permanent spell cast with some of
# its mana, however little (the Pools' mana is only a third of the cost): Island becomes a copy of it until end of turn.

